[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963981469","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107413#issuecomment-2963981469","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107413","id":2963981469,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wqsSd","user":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T19:53:57Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T19:53:57Z","body":"I'm wondering, if there are other cases besides IME `LineEdit` and `TextEdit`, where this issue happens.\r\nIn that case this fix would be better moved to `get_popup_base_transform`, so that other nodes also benefit from this fix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963981469/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2964448988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107413#issuecomment-2964448988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107413","id":2964448988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wsebc","user":{"login":"pippenpaddleopsicopolis","id":12509097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTA5MDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12509097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis","html_url":"https://github.com/pippenpaddleopsicopolis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pippenpaddleopsicopolis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T22:28:57Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T22:28:57Z","body":"> I'm wondering, if there are other cases besides IME `LineEdit` and `TextEdit`, where this issue happens. In that case this fix would be better moved to `get_popup_base_transform`, so that other nodes also benefit from this fix.\r\n\r\nI can't seem to find any documentation about `get_popup_base_transform`. Do you know why is it used here? Maybe @bruvzg knows. Also note that `get_popup_base_transform` is never called when I tested (running the MRP on MacOS ) because `get_window()->get_embedder()` is null. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2964448988/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2965092934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107413#issuecomment-2965092934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107413","id":2965092934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wu7pG","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T04:45:03Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T04:45:03Z","body":"'popup_base_transform`, is for native windows, which are completely independent of parent and use screen coordinates. But IME is a sub element of the native window, and uses native window client area coordinates. So it's a different thing. I do not think there are any other cases of IME use except line/text edit.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2965092934/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"m